  "description": "Water-source heat pumps in each zone, exchanging heat with a ground loop. The loop's supply is a temperature source standing in for the ground heat exchanger; ground_hx_loop drives its source schedule from the loop inlet temperature with an EMS program, and ems_params gives the control-temperature envelope the linear reset is derived from. The loop also opts out of the conventional bypass and outlet pipes.",
